{"id": "Dc3zXkXSxpH", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"DESIGN\" to get this free Design.MD library with over 2000+Website Design Systems.\n\nIf you want better front end designs, don't start prompting from scratch.\n\nYou can use the design language of top brands like Tesla, Apple, Ferrari, and even Anthropic.\n\nDirectly inside your own designs.\n\nSomeone reverse engineered over 2,000 websites from the world's top brands.\n\nThey turned them into design files that your Claude Code can read and use directly.\n\nEach file contains their entire visual system.\n\nThe exact colors, fonts, spacing, and layouts they use.\n\nPlus clear rules on what to use and what to avoid.\n\nSo you just pick the one that fits your project.\n\nYou drop it into your coding agent.\n\nIt builds your entire UI in that exact style in minutes.\n\nThink of it like handing your AI a style guide straight from a real design team, instead of guessing what looks good.\n\nNo more staring at a blank screen wondering where to even start.\n\nYou already know the exact brand aesthetic you're going for, now your AI does too.\n\nPlus the whole library is completely free right now.\n\n#designmd #claudecode #3dwebsite #websitedesigning #aicoding", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788538940, "like_count": 4603, "comment_count": 11622, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28437059839318635a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.761, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMVTyR7b3Z3TIIkhybN2eiPtViz8eyMjgmQKonxdn_am0A9ScnrjNgaiU93aexiIfvqykm6HwJfjLXB9CVxZWr0QasuwOgOTL4MFo4.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdrF9ilFiImwSZQ7RgVvPx6U8TqNMHUpMX118_NyjATWc6rfs9o60LCvM2DmOHs4DxY&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=54loQPjCTHEQ7kNvwHaKb8n&%3